export anchor UrushiLacquerStyle:
    number: 254
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Urushi lacquer
    idea: A design tool laid out like a set of black lacquer trays, where gold leaf hairlines frame each panel, the inspector stacks like tiered boxes and a single vermilion marks what is chosen.
    base: dark
    palette:
        lacquer: #0e0b0b, the page, canvas and field wells
        tray: #171112, the header, panels, status bar and style sheet
        tier: #1f1617, tool tiles and the comment card
        tierBand: #2a1210, inspector tier heading bands and the selected layer
        ink: #f1e8d8, text
        muted: #b3a48c, meta, layer kinds and status text
        gold: #d6b05a, labels, numerals, handles, the frame outline, status icons and focus
        goldLine: #6e5a35, tray rims and dividers
        seam: #33261f, field and row borders
        vermilion: #a3291c, Share, the pressed Move tool, the seal mark and the comment pin
        rice: #fff4e8, text on vermilion
        guide: #c2291a, the 32 px spacing guide with white text
    type:
        Titles in a book serif stack, Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype,
        Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia. Text in system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto,
        Helvetica Neue, Arial. Base 14px at 1.5. The sheet title is 30px 600
        serif, the file name 15px 600 serif, layer names 14px 600, meta 12 to
        13px, tray and tier labels 11 to 12px caps tracked 0.14 to 0.16em in
        gold, and layer numerals 01 to 07 in 12px italic serif gold.
    layout:
        Three columns of 252px, the canvas and 292px under a header row. The
        header is one tray split in three. Left holds a round vermilion seal
        with a gold ring and the file as Brightwork Canvas over Website
        redesign / Home v3. The middle holds the six tools as 40px square
        lacquer tiles with Move filled vermilion with a short gold bar under
        it, then a 66% zoom well. Right holds three round avatars, an outlined
        gold Present and a vermilion Share. Below, the layers tray floats 16px
        in from the left with gold numerals, a kind icon, the name and a sub
        line, Hero tinted red with a gold left edge and a Selected tag,
        Features with a Collapsed tag. The canvas is plain lacquer with a
        faint warm gloss from the top and the white Hero frame outlined in
        gold with square gold handles. The inspector tray on the right is a
        stack of tiers like a lidded box set, each with a dark red band
        heading for Position and size, Fill, Auto layout with Vertical, Corner
        radius and Export, holding italic serif keyed fields such as X 0 and W
        1440. The status bar runs the full width with gold diamonds between
        items. Below 860px everything stacks with the canvas first and the
        tools become a sticky bottom tray.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px gutters around trays, 18px tray padding, 10px between fields.
    density: Medium. Seven layer rows with a sub line each and five inspector tiers.
    corners: 10px trays, 6px tiles, fields and buttons, round seal, avatars and pin.
    borders: 1px gold line rims on every tray, 1px seam borders on fields, a 3px gold left edge on the selected layer.
    shadows: A deep soft shadow under trays and the frame, 0 12px 28px black at 55 percent, with a faint warm top highlight.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.5px stroke, 18px. Selected uses a circled check,
        Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check, people editing
        two figures and the version a tag, always with the word.
    focus: A 2px gold outline offset 3px.
    tone: Quiet and formal. Caps tier names such as Position and size and Export.
